        <updateDate>2025-08-15T21:15:27Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Stop Foreign Funds in Elections Act</strong></p> <p>This bill prohibits contributions or donations by foreign nationals in connection with state or local ballot initiatives, referenda, or recall elections.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
